    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to survive the Apocalypse!</strong><br>In <i>Apocalypse Rush</i>, you\u2019ll face endless hordes of zombies in frantic combat packed with insane weapons, special abilities, and powerful upgrades. Test your reflexes, build your strategy, and fight until the very last second!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from dozens of weapons, unlock exclusive skins, and use defensive items to hold back increasingly aggressive waves of enemies. With fast-paced action, <i>Apocalypse Rush</i> delivers an intense experience for players seeking adrenaline and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive long enough?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>SURVIVE ENDLESS HORDE WAVES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669990/extras/ed70ee54e8c32850a37c8f4a03303f6a.poster.avif?t=1748873118\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669990/extras/ed70ee54e8c32850a37c8f4a03303f6a.webm?t=1748873118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669990/extras/ed70ee54e8c32850a37c8f4a03303f6a.mp4?t=1748873118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>UNLEASH YOUR SPECIAL AND CLEAR THE SCREEN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669990/extras/02bb8f776e9dc42c1bb9ccc24816e57f.poster.avif?t=1748873118\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam